<p>By placing an order through the Website, the Buyer accepts that the sales contract is concluded directly between the Buyer and the corresponding third-party Seller, with {{empresa}}'s intervention being limited to providing the technological platform for such transaction, managing the payment collection on behalf of the Seller, and providing auxiliary management and support services.</p>
